<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Product Change Notification</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .header-logo { float: right; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for ABB Logo -->
    <span style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold;">ABB</span>
  </div>
  <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin-top: 0;">Product Change Notification</h1>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">PCN Details: All PCS and PCSL conduits in black, grey and orange.</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Date of PCN: <span data-field="date_of_pcn">{{ date_of_pcn }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>PCN Document No.: <span data-field="pcn_document_no">{{ pcn_document_no }}</span></td>
      <td>PCN valid as of: <span data-field="pcn_valid_as_of">{{ pcn_valid_as_of }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Product Manager: <span data-field="product_manager">{{ product_manager }}</span></td>
      <td>Obsolescence Date: <span data-field="obsolescence_date">{{ obsolescence_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Plant Manager: <span data-field="plant_manager">{{ plant_manager }}</span></td>
      <td>Change Date: <span data-field="change_date">{{ change_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>Dear Valued Customer,</p>
  <p>As a follow-up to our communication issued on <span data-field="communication_date">{{ communication_date }}</span>, regarding material composition and certifications in our product families PCS and PCSL, we are issuing the following Product Change Notification.</p>

  <p>PCS and PCSL conduits in black, grey and orange are affected by this PCN:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>New material will comply with EN45545-2 HL2 and will not be certified to NFPA 130.</li>
    <li>Old material that complies to EN45545-2 HL2 and is NFPA 130 certified becomes obsolete effective <span data-field="obsolete_effective_date">{{ obsolete_effective_date }}</span>. Please refer to the technical data sheets for PCS, PCSL and PCS XO conduits at <span data-field="technical_data_sheet_url">{{ technical_data_sheet_url }}</span>.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>In order to clarify the distinction between the OLD and NEW material, we are implementing the following identification methods that will be in effect until <span data-field="implementation_date">{{ implementation_date }}</span>:</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <!-- Placeholder for Product Specification Change Table -->
    <table>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">ABB</td>
        <td style="width: 30%; text-align: center;">PCSG-23B.50</td>
        <td style="width: 40%; text-align: right;">QTY 50M</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="text-align: center;">[Barcode Placeholder]</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;">[Barcode Placeholder]</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;">CE</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>Orders placed for any part numbers in the product families PCS, PCSL and PCS XO will be affected by this PCN.</p>
  <p>Customers who do not require NFPA 130 product certification might receive OLD and NEW product while inventory of the OLD product lasts.</p>
  <p>If you wish NOT to receive mixed product, please inform your sales representative immediately. If you require products with NFPA 130 certification, please refer to XPCS conduits.</p>
  <p>If you have any concerns about this PCN, please contact your local ABB sales office.</p>

  <p style="font-size: 10px; margin-top: 50px;">Uncontrolled if printed, valid on <span data-field="document_issue_date">{{ document_issue_date }}</span> only. For latest information check <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span>.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10px;">Document ID: Product Change Notification</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10px;">Issued by: Global Product Management</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10px;">Page: 1</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for ABB Logo -->
    <span style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold;">ABB</span>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>ABB Switzerland Ltd.</p>
    <p>PMA Cable Protection</p>
    <p>Aathalstrasse 90, 8810 Uster, Switzerland</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: right;">
    <p>From:</p>
    <p>Business area</p>
    <p>Phone direct</p>
    <p>Fax direct</p>
    <p>E-mail</p>
    <p>Reference No.</p>
    <p>Page</p>
    <p>Date</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>Global Product Management</p>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 50%;">
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="from.business_area">{{ from.business_area }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="from.phone_direct">{{ from.phone_direct }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="from.fax_direct">{{ from.fax_direct }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="from.e_mail">{{ from.e_mail }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="from.reference_no">{{ from.reference_no }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="from.page">{{ from.page }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="from.date">{{ from.date }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <p>Ricardo Portillo</p>
    <p>Director Global Product Manager</p>
    <p>Flexible Conduit Systems</p>
    <p><em>Ricardo Portillo</em></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p>ABB Switzerland Ltd.</p>
      <p>PMA Cable Protection</p>
      <p>Aathalstrasse 90, 8810 Uster, Switzerland</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
      <p>VAT No. CHE-116.265.869.MWST</p>
      <p>www.abb.com</p>
      <div style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold;">PMA</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>